I found a bug worth fixing before finalizing: `.rstrip(".git")` in my repo-name parser strips trailing characters from the set `{., g, i, t}`, which silently truncated several cloned-repo names (e.g. `deep-analog` → `deep-analo`, `dust` → `dus`). It didn't cause wrong downloads this run, but it makes the report's skip list inaccurate. Let me fix it and regenerate.
